  "name": "Mushroom and Vegetable Ramen",
  "subtitle": "A spicy, savory noodle bowl with mushrooms and crisp vegetables",
  "description": "Simmer vegetables and seasonings in water, then cook ramen noodles in the broth until tender. Finish with reserved green onions.",
